      "text": "## Core Theoretical Families"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#011",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:criminology:00-overview, git-history:criminology:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "criminology/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "criminology/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:criminology:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "criminology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "criminology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Criminology - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "| Family | Key Claim | Level of Analysis | Policy Implication |\n|--------|-----------|-------------------|--------------------|\n| **Classical** | Crime = rational calculation of cost/benefit | Individual | Increase deterrence, swift punishment |\n| **Strain** | Crime = frustrated access to legitimate goals | Social structure | Expand opportunity, reduce inequality |\n| **Social Control** | Crime = weak bonds to conventional society | Social bonds | Strengthen family, school, community |\n| **Labeling** | Crime = created by societal reaction | Interaction/labels | Divert, decriminalize, reduce stigma |\n| **Differential Association** | Crime = learned in intimate groups | Social learning | Disrupt criminal networks, mentorship |\n| **Conflict** | Crime = power and class struggle | Macro/political | Challenge power structures |\n| **Life-Course** | Crime = contingent on life events and turning points | Longitudinal | Target critical transitions |\n| **Routine Activity** | Crime = motivated offender + suitable target + absent guardian | Situational | Environmental design, guardianship |"
    },
