        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Criminology - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n|                  CRIME ICEBERG                           |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                          |\n|  ~~~~ WATERLINE ~~~~                                     |\n|                                                          |\n|  OFFICIAL STATISTICS (UCR, NIBRS, police data)          |\n|  [visible tip]                                           |\n|                                                          |\n|  DARK FIGURE                                             |\n|  - Not reported to police                                |\n|  - Reported but not recorded                             |\n|  - Crimes police don't discover (white-collar, drugs)    |\n|  [submerged mass]                                        |\n|                                                          |\n|  SELF-REPORT SURVEYS (NCVS, BCS, ICVS)                  |\n|  [attempts to measure submerged portion]                 |\n+----------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
