        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Key measurement sources:**\n- **UCR (Uniform Crime Reports)** -- police agency reports, FBI-compiled, hierarchy rule problem\n- **NIBRS (National Incident-Based Reporting)** -- replaces UCR, incident-level data\n- **NCVS (National Crime Victimization Survey)** -- household survey, catches unreported crime\n- **Self-report studies** -- captures offending behavior directly, good for drug/minor crime\n- **ICVS (International Crime Victimization Survey)** -- cross-national comparison"
